Package: MathematicalModelingStudy
Title: Companion Code for An Introduction to Mathematical Modeling of Infectious Diseases (Li, 2018)
Version: 0.1.0
Description: R Markdown companion notebooks implementing every model, derivation, and
    exercise from Michael Y. Li's "An Introduction to Mathematical Modeling of Infectious
    Diseases" (Springer, 2018), built section by section.
Depends: R (>= 4.2)
Imports:
    ggplot2,
    dplyr,
    tidyr,
    deSolve,
    pracma,
    plotly,
    latex2exp,
    rmarkdown,
    minpack.lm,
    knitr
License: MIT
Encoding: UTF-8
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
